        "comments": "The Scrub jay HCP has been received. Per HCP guidelines, no woody vegetation removal is allowed during scrub-jay nesting season which runs from March 1 to June 30. No permits will be approved during the nesting season.The SJ mitigation fees have been invoiced and must be paid in full prior to the start of work.",
